TITLE Mix river water and seawater, report molality of HCl
SOLUTION 1 River
    pH      6.0
    Cl      10
SOLUTION 2 Seawater
    pH      8.1
    Cl      19000
MIX 1
    1 0.7
    2 0.3
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file mix_hcl.sel
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings m_HCl
    10 PUNCH MOL("HCl")
END
